# match_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- setup

~ var $weather := "fog"

-- forecast

match $weather
  storm
    > Lightning over the breakwater.
    WREN
      Stay inside.
  fog
    > A wall of grey at the end of the pier.
    WREN
      Walk slow.
  clear
    > The sun cuts through the rigging.
    WREN
      Good day for it.
  _
    WREN
      I have no opinion on the weather.

WREN
  Either way, the bell still needs ringing.
